ADDITIONAL NOTICE ON LAWFUL USE

This software performs active network checks (TCP connections, HTTP requests,
DNS queries, TLS handshakes). Running such checks against systems you do not
own, or do not have explicit written permission to test, may be a criminal
offence under computer-misuse legislation (for example the Computer Fraud and
Abuse Act, the UK Computer Misuse Act, or Pakistan's Prevention of Electronic
Crimes Act).

The licence above grants copyright permissions only. It does NOT grant
permission to test, scan or access any third-party system. That permission must
come from the system's owner.
